475
00:17:51,280 --> 00:17:55,640
everything right. They went to the

476
00:17:53,080 --> 00:17:57,640
platform that promises to verify. They

477
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:59,360
paid the premium. They waited for the

478
00:17:57,640 --> 00:18:02,360
authentication email that says your

479
00:17:59,360 --> 00:18:04,400
shoes have been inspected and verified.

480
00:18:02,360 --> 00:18:05,880
And they still ended up with a fake

481
00:18:04,400 --> 00:18:08,520
because the fakes have gotten good

482
00:18:05,880 --> 00:18:10,400
enough that a trained authenticator with

483
00:18:08,520 --> 00:18:12,480
