485
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:17,400
third layer of cost that's even harder

486
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:19,680
to measure. The entire resale sneaker

487
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:22,640
market, which is worth billions on its

488
00:18:19,680 --> 00:18:24,720
own, depends on trust. The moment buyers

489
00:18:22,640 --> 00:18:27,080
