490
00:18:24,720 --> 00:18:30,200
can truly guarantee authenticity, the

491
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:32,360
whole market contracts. Prices drop,

492
00:18:30,200 --> 00:18:34,760
volume drops, sellers who deal

493
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:36,640
exclusively in real shoes get undercut

494
00:18:34,760 --> 00:18:39,040
