495
00:18:36,640 --> 00:18:40,880
operators can't compete on price against

496
00:18:39,040 --> 00:18:43,160
someone whose product costs a tenth of

497
00:18:40,880 --> 00:18:45,640
the retail floor. Counterfeiting doesn't

498
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:47,560
just steal from Nike. It poisons the

499
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:49,680
marketplace that legitimate resellers

500
00:18:47,560 --> 00:18:52,040
depend on. The cost runs in every

501
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:53,800
direction. Nike loses revenue. The

502
00:18:52,040 --> 00:18:55,840
platforms spend millions building and

503
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:57,680
staffing authentication systems. The

504
00:18:55,840 --> 00:18:59,840
buyers pay real money for goods that may

505
00:18:57,680 --> 00:19:01,680
not be real. And the counterfeiters keep

506
00:18:59,840 --> 00:19:03,960
producing and selling for multiples of

507
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:06,120
the manufacturing cost because every

508
00:19:03,960 --> 00:19:07,960
layer of defense built against them is a

509
00:19:06,120 --> 00:19:12,600
layer they've already figured out how to

510
00:19:07,960 --> 00:19:14,000
get past. So, Nike is losing billions,

511
00:19:12,600 --> 00:19:15,880
Buyers are getting burned.

512
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:17,960
Authentication platforms are spending

513
00:19:15,880 --> 00:19:20,520
millions trying to keep up. And the

514
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:23,520
legal system, it's trying. But the

515
00:19:20,520 --> 00:19:25,600
scoreboard isn't pretty. Nike has not

516
00:19:23,520 --> 00:19:27,880
been sitting still. They have launched

517
00:19:25,600 --> 00:19:30,120
legal campaigns that on paper look

518
00:19:27,880 --> 00:19:31,920
aggressive. The company filed lawsuits

519
00:19:30,120 --> 00:19:33,800
against dozens of alleged counterfeit

520
00:19:31,920 --> 00:19:35,520
networks operating through websites and

521
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:38,040
social media accounts selling fake

522
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:39,480
shoes. They sued StockX for allegedly

523
00:19:38,040 --> 00:19:41,400
